UI could be improved. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3731771508/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3731799879","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114715#issuecomment-3731799879","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114715","id":3731799879,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ebr9H","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T04:15:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T04:15:12Z","body":"In AddPointMode, it is indeed confirmed that movement is possible. However, this is not an issue with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114686, nor has it occurred as a regression.\r\n\r\nIn SelectPoint mode, I think it's not good as consistency is lost. If Node3D or Skeleton3D could be moved in SelectMode, I believe consistency would exist there, but that is not the case.\r\n\r\nTherefore, I determine that only a visual improvement is necessary here.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3731799879/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3850931925","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114715#issuecomment-3850931925","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114715","id":3850931925,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7liI7V","user":{"login":"ryevdokimov","id":105675984,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkx80A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T03:59:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T03:59:00Z","body":">If Node3D or Skeleton3D could be moved in SelectMode, I believe consistency would exist there, but that is not the case.\r\n\r\nPart of the intention of the select tool was so that it could interact with subgizmo handles without accidentally interacting with any geometry underneath it. `Skeleton3D` never had a mechanism where the point itself be interacted with besides selection. `Path3D` does. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102085 will allow `Path3D` handles to snap to collisions which allows for workflows to circumvent the transform gizmo in a more meaningful way. \r\n\r\nI'm not married to this PR, but I wouldn't say that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114849 supersedes it in any way. \r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3850931925/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3916851948","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114715#issuecomment-3916851948","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114715","id":3916851948,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pdmrs","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-17T20:11:40Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:11:40Z","body":"If there's contention to if this is superseded by #114849, then I'll leave this open","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3916851948/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3917967120","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114715#issuecomment-3917967120","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114715","id":3917967120,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ph28Q","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-18T01:31:05Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T01:33:09Z","body":"This PR can be left open, but I disagree to merge this because the change causes confusion in roles.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/co